  "remarks": "LLC Megion Drilling Operations Department is a company active in the Russian energy sector. As part of Slavneft, an important Russian oil and gas company, LLC Megion Drilling Operations Department engages in oil extraction, transport and production, exploiting in particular oir fields in Western Siberia. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides substantial revenues to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, LLC Megion Drilling Operations Department is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
